{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FOR MOTHER MATRON </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lizzy is a girl living in The Boarding, a walled city surrounded by fog. All who live here serve the mysterious Mother Matron, its revered leader who hasn\u2019t been seen in person in many years. Periodically, the Mother Matron selects residents to become Surveyors, tasked with exploring the dark unknown tunnels that lie underground to find the key to a better future for the collective. The odds of survival are slim to none. It is an honor and a death sentence. One day, Lizzy finds herself on the draft...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using your wits and quick thinking, you must guide Lizzy through the dangers beneath. Will you survive? Will you find Paradise? Or will you be lost to the dark forever?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For Mother Matron is a passion project inspired by Silent Hill, Spirit Hunter: Death Mark, bizarro fiction, and the works of Thomas Ligotti. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- A terrifying narrative in a strange world with strange people</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- A striking dark art style with grimy environments and fleshy monsters</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- Life-or-death decision making</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- Partial Voice Acting</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- Atmospheric original OST by Velvetique &amp; Angel B.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- Approximately 2 \u2013 4 hours of content</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- 2 Endings (and many more dead ends)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- Rats</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- Rats</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- Rats</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Midday Meat Pocket","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2162960/8e03b93d6358b83369e8b2cbcef570a4e4f94ff8.jpg"},{"name":"Woops","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2162960/1258e799c04ab569e0c63110e90721964666b22e.jpg"},{"name":"Detuned Radiohead","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2162960/0ff966af816c95ce24920477c491be970af26904.jpg"},{"name":"Cog Operated Boy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2162960/ff3b69c05a6d5f1b78c03f0c067d71491e00d334.jpg"},{"name":"Kiss of Life","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2162960/662b317245e6d27658dc6dc30f5facba8d88f126.jpg"},{"name":"Memento Doloris","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2162960/e2218f82e05023c189e0407a6b4be047a0367c95.jpg"},{"name":"Paradise is to be Unborn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2162960/dc70e3a91a1af3925c35340971b2708ac11c0bd2.jpg"},{"name":"Woofs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2162960/881fa20cca440539817a531b84c59aaf2c4166ea.jpg"},{"name":"Hate When That Happens","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2162960/5e231ed9ad02e9bf449ae7572801d0fe0182470d.jpg"},{"name":"Surveyor of Legend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2162960/8fbc492d2b79d78bfca9b14ec0bb2fc3de9ac46d.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2162960?t=1764499315","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2162960?t=1764499315","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162960/ee423394765c280c7d621d80bc4fec3743cee575/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764499315","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162960/ee423394765c280c7d621d80bc4fec3743cee575/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764499315","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This is a visual novel horror adventure about young people surviving life or death situations. As such, it contains content that may not be suitable for all audiences such as Violence, Death, Blood, Gore, Drugs use, Themes of Depression and descriptions of Suicide and Self harm."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FOR MOTHER MATRON </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lizzy is a girl living in The Boarding, a walled city surrounded by fog. All who live here serve the mysterious Mother Matron, its revered leader who hasn\u2019t been seen in person in many years. Periodically, the Mother Matron selects residents to become Surveyors, tasked with exploring the dark unknown tunnels that lie underground to find the key to a better future for the collective. The odds of survival are slim to none. It is an honor and a death sentence. One day, Lizzy finds herself on the draft...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using your wits and quick thinking, you must guide Lizzy through the dangers beneath. Will you survive? Will you find Paradise? Or will you be lost to the dark forever?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For Mother Matron is a passion project inspired by Silent Hill, Spirit Hunter: Death Mark, bizarro fiction, and the works of Thomas Ligotti. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- A terrifying narrative in a strange world with strange people</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- A striking dark art style with grimy environments and fleshy monsters</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- Life-or-death decision making</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- Partial Voice Acting</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- Atmospheric original OST by Velvetique &amp; Angel B.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- Approximately 2 \u2013 4 hours of content</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- 2 Endings (and many more dead ends)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- Rats</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- Rats</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- Rats</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Velvetique Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162960/cceb1f4bccdfb2d5fda4ddd006b2f119f17c54e4/header.jpg?t=1764499315","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OSX 10.6<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Pentium 4 - 1.8 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Display 1280x720<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OSX 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3 2.0 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Display 1920x1080<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2162960/370381141/f92291700212d038101830fda1534e53dc86009f/1764070996/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764499313","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2162960/370381141/f92291700212d038101830fda1534e53dc86009f/1764070996/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764499313","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2162960/370381141/f92291700212d038101830fda1534e53dc86009f/1764070996/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764499313","id":257237613,"name":"Anniversary Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257237613/0f0f7672e4eab7dc3bf098c5c5a0e0e1a697dcd5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764499313"}],"name":"For Mother Matron","pack